{"he":"ריצה","en":"running","alt":[],"from":"lexicon","tr":"ritzah"},{"he":"אוסף","en":"collection","alt":[],"from":"lexicon","tr":"osef"},{"he":"יוגה","en":"yoga","alt":[],"from":"lexicon","tr":"yoga"},{"he":"שוחה","en":"swims","alt":["swimming"],"from":"skill","tr":"sokheh"},{"he":"רץ","en":"runs","alt":["running"],"from":"skill","tr":"ratz"},{"he":"רצה","en":"runs (feminine)","alt":[],"from":"skill","tr":"ratzah"},{"he":"רוקד","en":"dances","alt":["dancing"],"from":"skill","tr":"roked"},{"he":"מצלמת","en":"photographs (feminine)","alt":[],"from":"skill","tr":"metzalemet"},{"he":"אוסף","en":"collects","alt":[],"from":"skill","tr":"osef"},{"he":"התחביב","en":"the hobby","alt":[],"from":"phrase","tr":"hatakhbiv"},{"he":"וצילום","en":"and photography","alt":[],"from":"phrase","tr":"vetzilum"},{"he":"הטיול","en":"the hike","alt":["the trip"],"from":"phrase","tr":"hatiyul"},{"he":"בולים","en":"stamps","alt":[],"from":"phrase","tr":"bulim"}],"lexemes":["תחביב","תחביבים","ציור","צילום","גינון","ריקוד","טיול","טיולים","שחייה","ריצה","אוסף","יוגה","שוחה","רץ","רצה","רוקד","מצלמת","אוספת","אוספים","בולים","הטיול","הציור","השחייה","הריצה","הריקוד","הגינון"],"tips":"## Hobbies and Leisure\n\nIsraelis enjoy an active lifestyle. Here are common hobby words:\n\n| Hebrew | Transliteration | Meaning |\n|---|---|---|\n| תחביב | takhbiv | hobby |\n| ציור | tziyur | drawing/painting |\n| צילום | tzilum | photography |\n| גינון | ginun | gardening |\n| ריקוד | rikud | dance |\n| טיול | tiyul | hike/trip |\n| שחייה | skhiyah | swimming |\n| ריצה | ritzah | running |\n| אוסף | osef | collection |\n| יוגה | yoga | yoga |\n\n### Talking About Hobbies\n- **מה התחביב שלך?** — What is your hobby?\n- **התחביב שלי הוא...** — My hobby is...\n- **אני אוהב/ת לעשות...** — I like to do...\n\n### Activity Verbs\n| Activity | Verb (m.) | Verb (f.) |\n|---|---|---|\n| swimming | שוחה (sokheh) | שוחה (sokhah) |\n| running | רץ (ratz) | רצה (ratzah) |\n| dancing | רוקד (roked) | רוקדת (rokedet) |\n| photographing | מצלם (metzalem) | מצלמת (metzalemet) |\n| collecting | אוסף (osef) | אוספת (osefet) |\n\nNote: **אוסף** can mean both \"collection\" (noun) and \"collects\" (verb, m.s. present). Context tells you which!"}